-- Populate Grant Chiasson's long_bio (expandable "About me" on lesson ready screen).
update public.coaches
   set long_bio = E'You don\u2019t stop being an athlete when the games end. You just change arenas.\n\nBut most former athletes in business lose the structure, drive, and identity that once made them elite.\nNow it\u2019s pressure, burnout, and the quiet thought: \u201cWhy don\u2019t I feel like myself anymore?\u201d\n\nI help former athletes in sales, finance, and executive roles rebuild their competitive edge through mental performance training.\n\nI\u2019m Grant Chiasson, former Division I quarterback turned Mental Performance Coach, certified by Brian Cain and Ben Newman.\n\nThe systems I\u2019ve studied are the same mental performance frameworks used by Ben Newman to help multi-billion-dollar organizations elevate their results and by Brian Cain to train thousands of professional athletes and coaches worldwide.\n\nThrough my Champion Operating System\u2122, I help high performers reclaim discipline, confidence, and clarity \u2014 so they can win again in business and life.\n\nIf you were built to compete, I\u2019ll help you do it with purpose, balance, and results.'
 where coach_key = 'grant-chiasson';
